{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["And you shall see the land, what it is — whether it is in its beginning a land of forests, or open country, or a land that is muddied and damp. For according to what you see of the land, you must prepare for it weapons of war, to clear the forests and ready the march of your troops. For they were certain that YHWH would give them the land of Canaan, but not without effort — rather through the conduct of battle formations." "Whether it is strong — all this is to inform them in what manner they should array themselves for battle."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:50:08.440851339Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}